{{Term/Store|Tunic of the Sky|Tunics of the Sky|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Tunic of the Sky can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SS|-}} [[Link]] [[amiibo]]. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain the Tunic of the Sky. It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]], but it cannot be [[Hateno Dye|Dyed]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The Tunic of the Sky, the [[Cap of the Sky]], and the [[Trousers of the Sky]] comprise the [[Hero of the Sky Set]], which resembles the [[Knight's Uniform]] from {{SS}}.<ref name="CaC 193"/> When the [[Armor Set]] has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the [[Master Sword]] Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn.

